# Model weight directory
#
# Jangan commit file di dalam folder ini. Model weight di-download on-site
# oleh admin klien via `scripts/download-models.sh`.
#
# Expected structure setelah download:
#   models/Qwen3-32B-AWQ/     — LLM primary (~20 GB)
#   models/bge-m3/            — Embedding (~2 GB)
#   models/Qwen2.5-VL-7B/     — VLM fallback (opsional, ~15 GB)
#
# Total footprint: ~25-40 GB
